OL,3,CTV-related anniversaries for 09 SEP
OL,4,CCHANNELS
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1985FPhillip Schofield presents the
OL,7,Flinks between children's programmes on
OL,8,FBBC One for the first time - in-vision.
OL,9,
OL,10,FUntil now, the BBC One announcer
OL,11,Fintroduced children's programmes
OL,12,Fout-of-vision, using the channel's
OL,13,Fstandard presentation (the globe symbol
OL,14,Fand slides).
OL,15,
OL,16,FSchofield presented the junctions from
OL,17,Fthe BBC One continuity announcer's
OL,18,Fsuite (NC1 Con, or 'The Broom Cupboard'
OL,19,Fas Schofield and his successors
OL,20,Freferred to it). NC1 Con had rarely
OL,21,Fappeared on-screen previously.
